---
const arsRate = 957;
const copRate = 4283;
const arsEstimate = Math.round(397 * arsRate).toLocaleString('es-AR');
const copEstimate = Math.round(397 * copRate).toLocaleString('es-CO');
---

<section
  class="py-20 px-4 md:px-20 bg-surface-lowest border-t border-line/30"
  id="inversion"
  aria-label="Inversión y Planes Preferenciales"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-[48px] leading-[48px] uppercase mb-4 text-white">
        Inversión <span class="text-cta">Seleccionada</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-cta mx-auto"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Matrícula Preferencial (Pago Único) -->
      <article
        class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col gap-6 relative overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-48 h-48 bg-accent/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <span
            class="inline-block font-body text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-sm bg-cta text-white mb-4"
          >
            Pago Único
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-[32px] uppercase text-white mb-2">Matrícula Preferencial</h3>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="text-2xl font-body font-bold text-text-variant mt-2">$</span>
            <span class="font-heading text-[80px] leading-none text-white">397</span>
            <span class="text-xl font-body font-bold text-text-variant mt-12">USD</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white font-body text-sm">
              <span
                class="material-symbols-outlined text-cta text-sm"
                style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                check_circle
              </span>
              Reserva tu vacante de una sola vez
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white font-body text-sm">
              <span
                class="material-symbols-outlined text-cta text-sm"
                style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                check_circle
              </span>
              Mejor valor por tu inversión
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white font-body text-sm">
              <span
                class="material-symbols-outlined text-cta text-sm"
                style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                check_circle
              </span>
              Aplica a cualquiera de los dos diplomados
            </li>
          </ul>

          <details class="group mb-2">
            <summary
              class="cursor-pointer list-none font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-accent-soft hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span
                class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"
              >
                chevron_right
              </span>
              Ver conversión estimada
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div class="bg-black/60 border border-line/60 rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
                <p class="font-body text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-text-variant mb-1">
                  Pesos Argentinos (ARS)
                </p>
                <p class="font-heading text-[24px] text-white">≈ ${arsEstimate} ARS</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-black/60 border border-line/60 rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
                <p class="font-body text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-text-variant mb-1">
                  Pesos Colombianos (COP)
                </p>
                <p class="font-heading text-[24px] text-white">≈ ${copEstimate} COP</p>
              </div>
              <p class="col-span-2 font-body text-[11px] text-text-variant opacity-60">
                Valores estimados a la fecha. La conversión final se confirma al momento del pago.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Plan Financiado -->
      <article
        class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col gap-6 relative overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cta/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <span
            class="inline-block font-body text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white mb-4"
          >
            Aplica para ambos diplomados
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-[32px] uppercase text-white mb-2">Plan Financiado</h3>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line/50 pb-4">
              <div>
                <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-text-variant mb-1">
                  Reserva de Vacante
                </p>
                <p class="font-heading text-[32px] text-white">
                  $35 <span class="font-body text-sm text-text-variant">USD</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <p class="font-body text-xs text-text-variant">Matrícula para asegurar lugar</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line/50 pb-4">
              <div>
                <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-text-variant mb-1">
                  Cuotas
                </p>
                <p class="font-heading text-[32px] text-white">
                  6 × $65 <span class="font-body text-sm text-text-variant">USD</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <p class="font-body text-xs text-text-variant">Cuotas mensuales</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-black/60 border border-line/60 rounded-lg p-4 mb-2">
            <p class="font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-accent-soft mb-2">
              Condiciones de Pago
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-variant">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-cta">•</span>
                Las cuotas se abonan del 1 al 10 de cada mes.
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-cta">•</span>
                Los pagos realizados fuera de este plazo tienen un 10% de recargo.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a
        href="#registro"
        class="btn-lift inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-heading text-[24px] px-10 py-4 rounded-lg bg-cta text-white uppercase hover:bg-cta-hover transition-colors"
      >
        SOLICITAR ENTREVISTA DE ADMISIÓN
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
